          "check_bonus": "0",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p><strong>【Yarrick Action】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Multi (2)</strong></p>\n<p>On miss, Eberon may perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with ⚔️ <strong>Darkfire Claw</strong>&nbsp;on the same missed targets.</p>",
