          "attrib_2": "DEX",
          "basic_name": "⚔️ Stomp and Stab",
          "check_bonus": "2",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p><strong>【Eberon &amp; Yarrick Action】</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/15_RDM/verflare.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">@UUID[JournalEntry.NUaxIAIPUu5Qnk8l]{Overflow}</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Can only be performed when both <strong>Eberon&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>Yarrick</strong> has available action (including this action) and consume 1 action for both <strong>Eberon&nbsp;</strong>and <strong>Yarrick</strong>.</p>\n<p>A creature inflicted with <strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7]{Grappled}</strong> will be hit by this attack <strong>regardless </strong>of the Accuracy check.</p>",
