      "name": "⭐The All-Defiled",
      "other_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Both&nbsp;<strong>Eberon&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>Yarrick&nbsp;</strong>consumes&nbsp;<strong>all remaining actions</strong> in this round (including this action) and enter <strong>Empowering Stance.</strong></p>\n<p>At the end of the round, unless both <strong>Eberon </strong>and <strong>Yarrick </strong>are <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/faze.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.MziQo5K1cu829GIU]{Break}</strong>,&nbsp;they will perform either&nbsp;<strong>Prime Ebon Breath</strong>, <strong>SoulScream Strike&nbsp;</strong>or <strong>Prime Ebon Veilded Strike</strong>, depending on the state of their <strong>Break Status.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Empowering Stance",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>All of the enemy suffers 20 <strong>dark </strong>damage that ignore Resistances and suffers <strong>2 stacks</strong> of <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/03_DRK/oblation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.NJ3m3y7QVBMDdc2Z]{Soulbroken}</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "【💥Zero Power】Soul Defiled Spear",
          "roll": ""
        }
      },
      "resource_value_1": "0",
      "resource_value_2": "0",
      "resource_value_3": "0",
      "rolled_atr1": "DEX",
      "rolled_atr2": "DEX",
      "shield_type": "PHYSICAL",
      "shield_value": "0",
      "spear_ef": "100",
      "spear_vu": "NA",
      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>The All-Defiled consists of&nbsp;<strong>2 combined bodies</strong> of&nbsp;<strong>Yarrick&nbsp;</strong>and&nbsp;<strong>Eberon:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Yarrick</strong> has&nbsp;<strong>2 Actions, </strong>and a <strong>Break Clock </strong>of<strong> 6 </strong>Sections that can be filled by attacks that matches <strong>weapon type vulnerability</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Eberon </strong>has&nbsp;<strong>2 Actions, </strong>and a <strong>Break Clock</strong> of <strong>6</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Sections that can be filled by attacks that matches <strong>element type vulnerability</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When a <strong>Break Clock</strong> is fully filled, only the owner of the Break Clock will enter <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/faze.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.MziQo5K1cu829GIU]{Break}</strong> and loses its Actions.</p>\n<p>When both Break Clock is fully filled during same round, each of the enemies receives <strong>1 Extra Turn.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Supreme Entity"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Yarrick's <strong>MIG </strong>and <strong>DEX </strong>die size<strong> </strong>cannot be decreased lower than its base die size.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Soulless Shell"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When the All-Defiled hits a creature with an attack, all hit creature is inflicted with <strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.NJ3m3y7QVBMDdc2Z]{Soulbroken}</strong>. If the target is in <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/condensed_libra.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.mINm5XmNcnbSzgrN]{Despair},&nbsp;</strong>inflict an extra stack of <strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.NJ3m3y7QVBMDdc2Z]{Soulbroken}.</strong></p>\n<p>Only activate <strong>once </strong>for each attack.</p>\n<p>When a creature is inflicted with <strong>Soulshattered</strong>, the All-Defiled recovers <strong>100 HP</strong> and <strong>100 MP.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "The Defiled"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>During <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/08_DRG/blood_for_blood.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM]{Crisis}</strong>, all attacks of the All-Defiled have increased <strong>Accuracy</strong> equals to the <strong>amount of buff and debuff it is currently having.</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Cornered Monstrosity"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>At the end of the All-Defiled's turn, its <strong>Zero Power clock</strong> is filled equals to <strong>【Creatures in conflict under <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/08_DRG/blood_for_blood.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM]{Crisis}】</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "【Zero Trigger】Soul Devouring"
        }
